sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Within a scan (UC-09), after the program has set XING_c.
    W->>V: XING_c, OCC of the approach blocks
    V->>V: OUT_XING_c := XING_c OR a train on the approach
    V-->>W: OUT_XING_c
    W->>W: OS encode
    W-->>M: crossings
    M-->>H: crossing_commands (line, block): active
    H->>TM: lights and gates
    TM-->>H: crossing state, next tick (UC-12)
